OL,3,GNEWSACritics hope 1929 law will stall
OL,4,Acar park plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners hope that a third attempt
OL,7,Fto turn derelict tennis courts into a
OL,8,Fcar park could be stalled after it
OL,9,Femerged the land might be protected by
OL,10,Fan old law.
OL,12,FNorth Norfolk District Council wants to
OL,13,Fbuild a car park at North Lodge Park in
OL,14,FCromer.
OL,16,FBut campaigners are fighting the plans
OL,17,Fto stop the loss of public space and
OL,18,Fbelieve there are legal protections
OL,19,Fover the site granted nearly 100 years
OL,20,Fago by the Ministry of Health.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
